@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@jwt = {{jwt}}
@requestId = {{requestId}}

### Resumen heuristico de alertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-analysis/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Top prioridades
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-analysis/top-priorities?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Resumen IA con Gemini/fallback
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alert-analysis/ai-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
